[1176.1s]   💬 Milestone M3 is built and verified. Summary of what was done:
[1176.1s]   💬 **Read of the source:** The contact sheet shows the trick — the camera does most of its 360° CCW roll *inside* the blackout, emerging at ~2.6s with a slight residual tilt that settles upright, while the world swaps to purple behind the black. So M3 = near-complete roll (351°, 9° residual tilt), not a mid-roll pose.
[1176.1s]   💬 **The delta on the live scene (now written to `build/m3.py`):**
[1176.1s]   💬 - **Camera retime** — pinned M2's exact f24 roll (174.26°) so the blackout frame is untouched, raced the roll to 351° at f32 (motion blur draws the ref's streaks through the seam), settling to the existing 360° key at f48. Added a small yaw pan (0 → 0.12rad → 0) so the tower sits right-of-centre at f32 while returning to zero for M4.
[1176.1s]   💬 - **Hero swap under the blackout** — green `hero_tower`/`crown` hide at f21; the committed `sr2_tower` asset appears there with its baked purple facade routed through a Gamma-3.0 → Emission chain (crushed dark circuit-board body, glowing window columns, legible "Silk Road 2.0" sign), emission ramping 0→7.5 over f25–31 (sign reads first).
[1176.1s]   💬 - **Palette swap keyed inside the black** — world background/volume-scatter, cloud dome ramp, city carpet colours, lesser-tower windows, and all five wisp/haze volumes (both scatter *and* emission colour — the missed Emission Color socket was the lingering green band) swap green→violet at f21–23 while strengths are zero, then ramp back f25–31. No palette bleed either direction.
[1176.1s]   💬 - **Seam cleanup** — seam lights fade 30→0 over f24–28; bloom eases 0.9→0.62 by f32; added a seeded near-camera warm light carpet (`city_p`, one instanced scatter) so the foreground reads as dense city.
[1176.1s]   💬 **Verification:** side-by-side eevee at f32 matches the ref — mean 35/255, 0% clipped, 3% crushed black, top-band structure σ21 vs ref σ25, dense blurred city band, violet billowed sky. Frame 24 re-checked: still the near-black M2 blackout with a few warm streaks.
